  "scope": "Unmodified historical reported values, not repaired or newly measured results. Original raw generations and checkpoints were not present in the repair workspace.",
  "reasons": {
    "evaluation": "Legacy HarmBench all-400 handling omitted contextual/copyright-specific evaluation and used a modified classifier template. Legacy bootstrap zero-event intervals could collapse to [0,0]. Rejudge the standard-200 subset from saved raw outputs where available.",
    "training": "GRPO reference regularization had an incorrect gradient; data used response labels as prompt intent and excluded sensitive benign requests; strict refusal fallback, teacher context, dropout and metadata required repairs. New training-v2 results require retraining.",
    "comparability": "Legacy 100-step ablations are not budget-matched to 200-step main runs. Several options changed together in the historical refusal intervention.",
    "mechanism": "A single fixed refusal-prefix probe does not establish a causal or policy-wide refusal effect; the old early/late share ignored unequal token counts.",
    "claims": "Historical numbers are retained for audit. They do not establish a validated safety-capability Pareto improvement."
  },
